1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,629
Welcome to Melody and
Barnaby's Music Nuggets!

2
00:00:05,629 --> 00:00:10,945
Hello, parents, teachers and helpers!

3
00:00:13,545 --> 00:00:20,811
Here, children learn to read
music, one small idea at a time.

4
00:00:23,611 --> 00:00:28,787
Each Nugget is a short video,
with a game to practise it.

5
00:00:31,787 --> 00:00:39,285
No sign-up. No adverts. Everything
here is free, and it stays free.

6
00:00:41,885 --> 00:00:46,829
The Nuggets go in order, so
each one builds on the last.

7
00:00:49,629 --> 00:00:58,706
Rhythm, notes, melody, scales and
harmony, all growing together.

8
00:01:01,706 --> 00:01:07,022
A new Nugget arrives every
Wednesday and Saturday.

9
00:01:09,822 --> 00:01:15,927
Made for children aged four to seven,
and the grown-ups who help them.

10
00:01:18,527 --> 00:01:24,353
To find the games, use the link
in each video's description.

11
00:01:27,353 --> 00:01:31,090
Or type this address into any browser.

12
00:01:35,890 --> 00:01:42,366
Subscribe, and every new Nugget will
be waiting in your Subscriptions.

13
00:01:45,466 --> 00:01:47,856
See you for the next Nugget!

